From: Dmitry Afonchenko <undermove1@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 13:41:54 +0400
Subject: [PATCH 096/113] Arc's extensions come over by themselves, each into
 its Arc profile's spaces

Added from the Chrome Web Store the way sync adds an account's extensions,
with the permissions the person granted in Arc; once per profile, after an
import (or at startup for a sidebar imported before). The Arc list in
Settings and the site menu show only the shown space's profile's.

